comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T03:43:41.572Z",codex-agent,"Phase 7 is specified as five estimated Feature children with acceptance criteria and blocked_by edges verified through pm deps. This slice includes canonical per-field/per-hunk conflict storage, explicit recording mode, readable projections, flat conflict reporting, lifecycle/transport closure and HEAD resolution. Ancestor selection and automatic descendant propagation remain pm-vcs-p7resolve; annotation, signing and bisect remain planned. Existing default/fail-on-conflict behavior and release workflows are preserved. All items remain open for orchestrator verification."
